// Installed by the optional defaults (make install-defaults) into Firefox's
// browser/defaults/preferences, where vendor defaults live: makes the Halloween
// theme the theme of every Firefox profile created from now on. Firefox starts
// a new profile with the theme this default names; without it, a theme found
// in Firefox's own folders stays off until someone picks it. Profiles that
// exist keep their theme, and one picked in about:addons still wins.
pref("extensions.activeThemeID", "@FIREFOX_ID@");
